    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "9A4E4FC60C3129F7",
      "text": "Accoglie su di sé il vento di Paldea e gira lento\\ne inesorabile...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "9A4E4EC60C312844",
      "text": "Quando entro in scena davanti agli occhi degli\\nsfidanti lanciandomi giù da lì, la lotta assume\\r\\nun ulteriore livello di profondità![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "84589E7D23A65B06",
      "text": "È proprio vero!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "84589D7D23A65953",
      "text": "Se lo dice lei...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "9A4E4DC60C312691",
      "text": "Sapevo che mi avresti capito, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nAaahahahah![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "9A4E4CC60C3124DE",
      "text": "Mi ci lancerei giù anche adesso...\\c\\nMa non ho dubbi che questa nostra lotta sarà\\nun capolavoro anche senza rimetterci le caviglie![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "9A4E4BC60C31232B",
      "text": "È il momento di lasciar parlare la nostra arte!\\nNon c’è espressione, se non nella lotta![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "9A4E4AC60C312178",
      "text": "Sei pront[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa? Che il nostro connubio artistico\\nabbia inizio![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "9A4E49C60C311FC5",
      "text": "Una gradazione originalissima di colori cangianti,\\ninarrestabilmente in movimento durante la lotta![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "9A4E48C60C311E12",
      "text": "Impetuosa eppure poetica! Un contrasto\\nineffabile! Mi prostro davanti a tanto genio![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "9A4ACBC60C2E13D4",
      "text": "Mi piace come lotti...\\c\\nMi fai rivivere quelle emozioni che provavo\\nall’inizio, quando l’arte entrò nella mia vita.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "9A4ACCC60C2E1587",
      "text": "Ah... Mi ero quasi scordato che questa era\\nuna verifica per conto della Supercampionessa.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "9A4ACDC60C2E173A",
      "text": "Beh, vedi un po’ tu cosa riferirle.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "9A4ACEC60C2E18ED",
      "text": "Aaah! Sono travolto dall’ispirazione!\\nLa sento! L’impellente voce delle muse![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "9A4AC7C60C2E0D08",
      "text": "Scusa, devo andare. La mia nuova creazione\\nmi reclama![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 8,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
